    "theme": "A consolation to the Prophet when his enemies mocked him as cut off: he has been given abundance, so he should turn wholly to his Lord, while the one who hates him is the one truly cut off.",
    "thread": "A river of abundance that flows from the top left across the scenes; it feeds prayer in the second and is absent from the cut-off tree in the third.",
